 "description": "Save 2\u201310 events from previous results as one shareable page spontanno.space/s/{code} \u2014 for \u00ab\u0441\u043a\u0438\u043d\u044c \u0441\u043f\u0438\u0441\u043a\u043e\u043c\u00bb, \u00ab\u0441\u043e\u0445\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0438\u00bb, \u00ab\u043e\u0442\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u043b\u044e \u0434\u0440\u0443\u0437\u044c\u044f\u043c\u00bb, or after planning an evening or a weekend. Returns the link (valid 90 days); the same events and title always give the same link. Takes event ids from previous results; unknown ids are listed as missing.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
   "event_ids": {
    "description": "Event ids from previous results, 2\u201310, in the order to show.",
